DEFINITIONS AND SCOPE
=======================

1.1 Definitions.

"AMBUSH" means the independent Minecraft mod authored by the Licensor and distributed under the display name "Create Aeronautics: AMBUSH". "AMBUSH" is used throughout this License as shorthand for that mod. The display name does not grant the Licensor ownership of, or licensing authority over, the names, marks, logos, assets, or other protected material of Create, Create Aeronautics, Aeronautics, the Create Team / Creators of Create, or the Simulated Team / Creators of Aeronautics.

"Licensor" means TiyunSol, the copyright holder of AMBUSH.

"You" means the individual or entity exercising permissions under this License.

"Covered Version" means AMBUSH version 1.1.6 and any subsequent version that expressly states that it is released under this License.

"Official Release" means a build of a Covered Version as distributed by the Licensor, with its contents unaltered.

"Protected Material" means the source code, compiled code, textures, models, sounds, artwork, schematics, structures, documentation, and other copyrightable material contained in or distributed with a Covered Version, excluding Example Content, Third-Party Materials, and the text of this License.

The text of this License may be reproduced verbatim for purposes of notice, reference, compliance, discussion, archival, or identification of the terms governing AMBUSH.

"Example Content" means files or content that AMBUSH or its documentation expressly identifies as an example, template, sample, or starter content.

"Independent Content" means content authored independently of AMBUSH's Protected Material using the documented data formats or public integration points of AMBUSH, including encounters, factions, armour sets, encounter definitions, quests, scripts, datapacks, schematics, structures, configuration packs, resource packs, and compatibility data.

"Addon" means a separate software project that depends upon, extends, or interoperates with AMBUSH.

"Modpack" means a collection of Minecraft mods, and optionally configuration and content, assembled for distribution or play as a single package.

"Third-Party Materials" means code, libraries, dependencies, assets, APIs, or other materials contained in or used by AMBUSH that are owned by parties other than the Licensor.

1.2 Application.

This License applies only to Covered Versions. It does not apply to AMBUSH version 1.1.5 or earlier, which are addressed in Section 4.

This License does not bind any future release of AMBUSH. The Licensor may release later versions of AMBUSH under different terms.

1.3 Limits of this License.

This License grants permissions only in respect of material that the Licensor owns or otherwise has authority to license.

It does not purport to grant, restrict, or modify any right in Third-Party Materials, and it does not affect rights that You hold independently of this License.

1.4 Reservation.

All rights not expressly granted by this License are reserved by the Licensor.

1.5 Acceptance.

You are not required to accept this License merely to receive or run an Official Release.

However, activities for which permission from the Licensor would otherwise be required, including redistribution under Section 2.3, are permitted only under this License.

By exercising a permission granted by this License, You accept and agree to comply with the conditions applicable to that permission.

Nothing in this Section requires acceptance of this License for conduct that You are independently entitled to perform under applicable law or under another applicable license.

